<title>DUBAI: Bank of Sharjah lifts 96 net, in bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Bank of Sharjah lifts 96 net, in bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (million dirhams unless stated)</p>
<p> Net income				    28.02     vs	 25.14</p>
<p> Profit available for appropriation    37.78     vs	 35.06</p>
<p> Net interest income			 40.37     vs	 36.87</p>
<p> Other income				  17.04     vs	 17.14</p>
<p> Provisions, other expenses		12.26     vs	 14.40</p>
<p> Total proposed cash dividend	    15.60     vs	 same</p>
<p> Proposed bonus issue			10.00     vs	 nil</p>
<p> Assets					1,094.10    vs	963.85</p>
<p>Full Name: Bank of Sharjah.</p>
<p>Note - The Sharjah government owns 20 percent of the bank. The rest is held by UAEnationals.</p>
</text>
